{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2021-04-26 07:40:00', 'title': 'RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND AND ANNOUNCES 7 PERCENT QUARTERLY RATE INCREASE', 'text': "WALTHAM, MASS., APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES CORPORATION (NYSE: RTX) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A DIVIDEND OF 51 CENTS PER OUTSTANDING SHARE OF RTX COMMON STOCK, WHICH REPRESENTS AN INCREASE OF MORE THAN 7 PERCENT OVER THE PRIOR QUARTER'S DIVIDEND AMOUNT."}